21;) is entered into by and among</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:155%"> ZYMEWORKS BC INC.</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:155%">, a corporation organized and existing under the laws of British Columbia (&#8220;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:155%">Zymeworks</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:155%">&#8221; or &#8220;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:155%">Licensor</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:155%">&#8221;), having a place of business at 114 East 4th Avenue, Suite 800, Vancouver, BC, Canada V5T 1G4, </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:155%">BEONE MEDICINES LTD.</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:155%">,</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:155%"> </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:155%">(formerly known as BeiGene, Ltd., a Cayman Islands exempted company incorporated with limited liability) a corporation organized and existing under the laws of  Switzerland having a registered office address at c&#47;o BeOne Medicines I GmbH, Aeschengraben 27, 4051 Basel, Switzerland (&#8220;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:155%">BeOne</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400